title: "NmapX - GUI Nmap Scanner for Windows"
abstract: "A modern, Synthwave-themed graphical user interface for Nmap on Windows.
  Built with Python, Flask, and HTML/CSS/JS. Features real-time scan output,
  structured results table, SQLite scan history, and PDF/CSV export.
  Developed as a Certified Ethical Hacking (CEH) final project."
